$ Deep-water wind-wave growth with the semi-implicit DIA per sweep
$
$ Identical to quad_dia2 apart from QUADRUPLET 1, so the two decks isolate the
$ semi-implicit variant of SWSNL1 against the explicit SWSNL2 of the default.
$ This is the only deck in the repository that reaches SWSNL1; without it the
$ bounds-checked CI build has nothing to check that routine against.
$
$ Without false time stepping the semi-implicit variant does not reach the
$ accuracy criterion on this fetch case: it stalls near 30-50 % of the wet
$ points and keeps oscillating there, also at 400 iterations. That behaviour
$ is a property of IQUAD = 1 itself -- it reproduces byte for byte on the
$ build from before the SWSNL1 argument regression -- so on its own this deck
$ is path coverage, not a converged physics reference. The ALFA note below is
$ what makes it converge; read the two together, and do not read the wave
$ heights of a run without ALFA as validated results.
$
$ ALFA=0.01 is not decoration. Without false time stepping QUADRUPLET 1 never
$ converges on this deck at all -- it enters a limit cycle and still oscillates
$ between 17% and 80% of the wet points after 599 iterations, at every wind
$ speed tried. SWSNL1 puts the raw derivative -DSNL/PI3 on the matrix diagonal,
$ which has no sign guarantee and can weaken it, where SWSNL2 splits on sign and
$ can only strengthen it. The SWAN technical documentation names exactly that
$ failure mode and offers false time stepping as the remedy, and it works: with
$ ALFA=0.01 the same run converges in 40 iterations. See the open item in
$ doc/bugfixes-tov-tu-delft-41.51.md.
PROJECT 'QUADDIA1' '001'
SET CARTESIAN
MODE STATIONARY ONEDIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN

CGRID REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 100000.0 0.0 40 0 &
      CIRCLE 36 0.04 1.0 34
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0.0 0.0 0.0 1 0 100000.0 1.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'bottom.bot' 1 0 FREE

WIND 15.0 0.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 0.05 2.0 0.0 20.0

GEN3 WESTH
QUADRUPLET 1
OFF BREAKING

POINTS 'GAUGES' 0.0 0.0 25000.0 0.0 50000.0 0.0 &
         75000.0 0.0 100000.0 0.0
TABLE 'GAUGES' HEADER 'quad_dia1.tbl' XP DEPTH HSIGN TM01 RTP REDTRIAD REDQUAD
SPECOUT 'GAUGES' SPEC1D ABS 'quad_dia1.spc'
TEST 1 0 POINTS XY 50000.0 0.0 S1D 'quad_dia1_sources.spc'

NUMERIC STOPC STAT MXITST=100 ALFA=0.01

COMPUTE
STOP
